Hello, Cedar Hollow families. Here is what to know this month.

# Dates to remember

table = event,date,time; Parent-teacher conferences,2026-11-05 and 2026-11-06,15:30 to 19:00; Book Fair (library),2026-11-09 to 2026-11-13,; No school (Veterans Day),2026-11-11,; No school (Thanksgiving break),2026-11-25 to 2026-11-27,

! Online booking for conferences opens on 2026-10-26.

# Reading challenge

Our whole school set a goal of 60,000 minutes read by 2026-12-18.

kpi Reading goal | 35.7% | 21,400 of 60,000 minutes | bar

Room 12 (Ms. Okafor's class) is in the lead at 3,150 minutes. Reading logs go in the red folder every Friday.

# Drop-off and pick-up

- The lane opens at 07:45. The bell is at 08:15.
- No left turns out of the lot onto Alder Street.
- Please use the east lot for pick-up.

!! Pick up by 15:45. After that, students go to the after-school office, which charges $5 per 15 minutes.

# Thank you

- To the 38 volunteers who ran the Fall Fair, which raised $9,640 for the library.
- To the families who sent in 412 cans of food for the neighborhood pantry.
